  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion into the Kenyan market and increasing diagnostic capacities for cardiovascular diseases in the Kenyan healthcare system.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Expanzia na kensk&#xfd; trh a zv&#xfd;&#x161;enie diagnostick&#xfd;ch kapac&#xed;t na kardiovaskul&#xe1;rne choroby v kenskom zdravotn&#xed;ctve.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion and implementation of cost-effective mobile app PMcardio for cardiovascular disease diagnosis and referral in Kenya. Collaboration with healthcare equipment and pharmaceutical supplier to expand PMcardio throughout the country, including providing ECG machines to Kilifi county. Additional app features being developed locally, with input from users and medical community.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Expanzia a implement&#xe1;cia n&#xe1;kladovo efekt&#xed;vnej mobilnej aplik&#xe1;cie PMcardio pre diagnostiku a odpor&#xfa;&#x10d;anie lie&#x10d;by kardiovaskul&#xe1;rnych chor&#xf4;b v Keni. Spolupr&#xe1;ca s dod&#xe1;vate&#x13e;om zdravotn&#xed;ckych zariaden&#xed; a farmaceutick&#xfd;ch produktov pre roz&#x161;&#xed;renie PMcardio po celej krajine, vr&#xe1;tane poskytnutia EKG pr&#xed;strojov do oblasti Kilifi. Rozvoj &#x10f;al&#x161;&#xed;ch funkci&#xed; aplik&#xe1;cie s miestnym v&#xfd;vojom a zoh&#x13e;adnen&#xed;m sp&#xe4;tnej v&#xe4;zby pou&#x17e;&#xed;vate&#x13e;ov a lek&#xe1;rskej komunity.</narrative>
  </description>
